title Fold AG -- the promised pruning, the cluster beneath it, and the first family with no absentee
prompt Autonomous loop -- Kyri voice and Radiant Style first, then REMEMBER and the itineraries, Standfast on reds, take the next agent-doable lap Lindy-first crux-first, one council-rota doc deep-read, send the increment as its own signed round.
think Standfast first. Read every living row of crux/REDS.md: rows 81, 83, 84, 98, 110 all carry closure notes proven on metal, and the ledger's tally is derived rather than recited. No open agent-closable red stands, so the constructive queue is genuinely free.
think Council rota, lap index 595 kyri logs mod 27 -> item 1, foundations/README.md. Deep-read. Its line that the foundations rest beneath the specifications -- the specs say what to build, the foundations say what it is for -- lands straight on a fold arc, which is specification work whose whole why is that a reader three years on can follow one body rather than forty-four copies of it. Lindy-first names the fold as durable rather than merely tidy.
think The running thread is the Caravan ladder fold arc, and the carry meter names the crux by measurement rather than by hand. Ran it: return_promised_reach at 42 rungs by 33 lines, 1,353 carried, alone at the head after fold AF lifted start_one.
think Hashed the family before trusting the count, as the last three recommends each asked. Forty-two bodies, one hash, thirty-three lines -- no absentee at all, which is the first time this arc has met a lead family standing whole across its whole cohort.
think Read the reach closure next. Eight symbols reached through the rung; seven already public in all forty-two, only prune_to private everywhere. Fold Z's rule pays a fourth time: the neighborhood was already widened by the folds around it.
think Five of the reached symbols are whole carrying families -- reachable_between, prune_to, pruning_promised, kept, pruned -- each in forty-four rungs. Hashed all five. Two carry one absentee apiece, and both are revoke.rye, the tier owner.
think revoke.rye's reachable_between differs by the word pub alone, which is a visibility split rather than a meaning. Its prune_to lacks one invariant the other forty-three carry -- a pruning always rebuilds from hands that hold their own line -- which is an elder body dated by a shape born after it. Folding heals the first and hands the elder the second, so both families close whole at forty-four.
think Checked every one of the forty-four against the harness import list, since fold AF was bitten at forty-five by confer.rye. None of the forty-four is imported by ladder_checks.rye, so the fold line does not bite this lap.
think Widening rode free in the delegate text itself: the replacement signature is written pub, so prune_to in forty-four rungs and reachable_between in revoke.rye gained the word in the same act that folded the body.
obs Carry falls 101,252 -> 98,507, a fall of 2,745, and the arithmetic closes with no remainder against the six cohorts. Ceiling brought down 101,300 -> 98,600 in the same commit as the code it measures, since a ceiling that lags its subject has stopped guarding.
obs Carrying families held at 707. All six folded whole -- one visibility split healed, none opened -- so the count neither rose nor fell, which is what a clean cluster fold looks like from the meter's side.
obs Checks 47 and spine 0 stand unmoved for the tenth fold running. The three named windows are genuinely orthogonal to the room, which is the fourth meter's whole argument still holding.
obs Found a docs-sync gap on the way in: fold AF landed without its caravan/README.md section, though the arc has written one per fold since fold C and the operator card points readers there for per-rung detail. Wrote AF's section beside AG's in the same commit rather than leaving the record with a hole -- a doc's claim about where the detail lives is assertable, and this one had quietly stopped being true.
obs The carry meter carried a small drift of its own: both queue asserts named return_promised_reach, so the line meant to name the family standing second named the first twice. Repointed to run_in_forbear, the true second.
